sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant C as Web or mobile app
  participant API as Backend API
  participant AI as AI service
  participant V as pgvector
  participant LLM as LLM provider
  S->>C: Ask question about a lesson
  C->>API: POST /ai/tutor/ask
  API->>API: Check role and enrolled subjects
  API->>AI: Question + school ID + subject IDs
  AI->>V: Search approved chunks in those subjects
  V-->>AI: Top matching chunks with lesson links
  AI->>LLM: Prompt with chunks, hint-only rules
  LLM-->>AI: Answer
  AI-->>API: Answer + source links
  API->>API: Log usage for the school
  API-->>C: Answer with sources
  C-->>S: Show explanation and links
